# balanced_resyn2x — BALANCED: two rewriting passes + double mapping
strash;
balance; rewrite; refactor; balance; rewrite;
rewrite -z; balance; refactor -z; rewrite -z; balance;
balance; rewrite; balance; rewrite;
rewrite -z; balance; rewrite -z; balance;
&get -n; &st; &dch; &nf {D}; &put;
buffer; topo; upsize {D}; dnsize {D};
&get -n; &st; &dch; &nf {D}; &put;
buffer; topo; upsize {D}; dnsize {D};
stime
